  "detailed_description": "The &amp;quot;Scheme for Fruit and Vegetable Preservation and Training Program in Horticulture Department HRT 5&amp;quot; by the Agriculture and Co-operation Department, Government of Gujarat, aims to empower women and urban citizens by offering hands-on training in value addition, preservation, canning, and kitchen-gardening of fruits and vegetables, along with promoting self-sustenance and nutritional well-being. The scheme includes financial support of ₹500/- per trainee per day- ₹250/- as a direct stipend and the remaining ₹250/- towards training material, expert honorarium, and other resources. \n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant should be a resident of Gujarat.\n  - The applicant should be willing to participate in horticulture-related skill development training.\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": null,
